SUMMARY:Maker Night: Origami Society of Toronto
DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, May 22 from 6 p.m. to 9 p.m.\, grab your friends and join us at Walker Court for Maker Friday: Origami Society of Toronto. Explore and learn the paper-folding art form of Origami from experienced members of the group. Free with General Admission. No advanced registration is needed\, and all materials are provided. For more details\, visit ago.ca/events/maker-night-origami-society-toronto.
