SUMMARY:💘 May Founders & Executive-Level Singles Mixer
DESCRIPTION:Meet like-minded singles who understand ambition\, responsibility\, and building something meaningful — in both life and relationships. \n \nWhen: Friday\, May 22\, 2026 | 7:30pm – 10:00pm \nWhere: Bar Rustica Late Night Pizza (571 Queen Street WestToronto) \nYou’ll feel at home here if you identify as someone like: \nFounders & Entrepreneurs \n\nStartup Founder / Co-Founder\nSmall Business Owner\nAgency Founder / Creative Director\nE-commerce Brand Owner\nTech Founder / Product Builder\n\nSenior Professionals & Executives \n\nDirector / Senior Manager / VP\nC-suite (CEO\, COO\, CFO\, CMO\, etc.)\nStrategy / Operations / Consulting Lead\nCorporate Law / Finance Leadership\n\nEstablished Professionals Across Fields \n\nSenior Lawyer / Associate / Partner\nInvestment Banker / Wealth Manager / Analyst\nCPA / Accountant / Financial Advisor\nHealthcare Professional in senior or specialized roles\nTech Lead / Engineering Manager / Product Manager\n\nIf your life looks like: \n\nFull calendar\, high responsibility\, big goals\nYou’re intentional about dating (not just casual swiping)\nYou want someone who understands ambition — not intimidated by it\nYou value emotional maturity + long-term partnership potential\n\n\n…you’ll feel like this room was built for you. \nCan’t make it? Follow Toronto Dating Hub for upcoming mixers & events!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/%f0%9f%92%98-may-founders-executive-level-singles-mixer/
LOCATION:Bar Rustica Late Night Pizza\, 571 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2A1\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 2A1
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Nightlife
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/f09f9298-may-founders-executive-level-singles-mixer.png
END:VEVENT
